title: F5OS Tenant
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/network/f5
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Monitors the operational state of BIG-IP tenant instances running on an F5
 Networks rSeries appliance. Alerts when a tenant is not in the Running state.
 Transient states (Starting, Stopping) yield WARNING; all other non-running
 states yield CRITICAL.

discovery:
 One service is created per tenant instance.
